{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Calvin! Haven't talked in a while! Last Friday I had a card-night with my friends, it was so much fun. We laughed and had a great time! Take a look at the photo!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-6bcc5478e3710e5fcc4bfce8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.292677+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6bcc5478e3710e5fcc4bfce8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6bcc5478e3710e5fcc4bfce8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave! Great to hear from you, card night sounds like a blast! Always love having fun with friends. Guess what? I scored a deal to continue collaboration with Frank Ocean! This is a dream come true for me, I've been working hard and it's finally paying off. No words can describe how happy I am."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-e9e480577086b65fca697df3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.312069+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e9e480577086b65fca697df3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e9e480577086b65fca697df3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow Calvin, congrats! Super excited for you. How did this chance come up?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-807c56cbd79fe32af934c0ac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.327193+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "807c56cbd79fe32af934c0ac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "807c56cbd79fe32af934c0ac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I had the opportunity to meet Frank Ocean at a music festival in Tokyo and we clicked. We've been speaking and sharing ideas we arranged a meeting and recorded a song in the studio at my mansion - it's been great!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-94ac6707d4f432297b2f1da4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.337331+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "94ac6707d4f432297b2f1da4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "94ac6707d4f432297b2f1da4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Tokyo sounds like an incredible experience!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-c91e4b014d55d13e369942fd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.351704+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c91e4b014d55d13e369942fd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c91e4b014d55d13e369942fd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: It was an incredible experience, Dave! The city was buzzing with energy and the festival crowd was so lively - it was like fuel for my soul. Look at this photo, that's amazing!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-cb936f99ae4f528e87c8f0a2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.362703+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cb936f99ae4f528e87c8f0a2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cb936f99ae4f528e87c8f0a2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, that sounds incredible! What was it like playing at the festival? Must have been an amazing experience."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-3e87abbb66c1277d5b2b3184", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.374704+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3e87abbb66c1277d5b2b3184", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3e87abbb66c1277d5b2b3184", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: It was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-abb521272e2c24778816d6fa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.384701+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "abb521272e2c24778816d6fa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "abb521272e2c24778816d6fa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Sounds like you had a blast! Did any other collaborations come out of that performance? Any upcoming concerts we should know about?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-b3a8745112fe6db6f85349e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.395875+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b3a8745112fe6db6f85349e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b3a8745112fe6db6f85349e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah Dave, someone even noticed my performance and now we're working together, which is wild. My tour ends soon and I'm heading to Boston. Maybe we can meet up then!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-0a2dd0dd33801642df2548ff", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.408036+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0a2dd0dd33801642df2548ff", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0a2dd0dd33801642df2548ff", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Sounds great! Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-0c9fdbb1e35fd2b6b978b905", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.421400+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0c9fdbb1e35fd2b6b978b905", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0c9fdbb1e35fd2b6b978b905", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Of course, Dave can't wait to catch up! I almost forgot, yesterday my friends and I recorded a podcast where we discuss the rapidly evolving rap industry!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-17bfa5fc1fa62e8e1d5c061e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.433621+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "17bfa5fc1fa62e8e1d5c061e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "17bfa5fc1fa62e8e1d5c061e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: That sounds fantastic! I'm looking forward to listening to your podcast and learning more about the rap industry. Keep up the great work!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-01437f4844f23f7dae00fa6e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.446825+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "01437f4844f23f7dae00fa6e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "01437f4844f23f7dae00fa6e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I'll let you know when the podcast will be uploaded. Take care!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-1137055ee0cba351ee79361d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.459337+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1137055ee0cba351ee79361d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1137055ee0cba351ee79361d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Sure, Calvin! Looking forward to hearing about it. See ya then!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-50/session_15-a0c8c36c9518334d8f1cc5c4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:26:08.471051+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a0c8c36c9518334d8f1cc5c4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a0c8c36c9518334d8f1cc5c4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
